OL,3,C'The Sopranos' actor Vincent Pastore
OL,4,Chas died aged 80
OL,6,FVincent Pastore, a veteran actor who
OL,7,Fplayed mobsters and tough guys and was
OL,8,Fbest known for his role opposite James
OL,9,FGandolfini on "The Sopranos," has died
OL,10,Faged 80.
OL,12,FBob McGowan, who had managed Pastore
OL,13,Fsince his run on "The Sopranos," said
OL,14,Fthat he learned of his death on
OL,15,FSaturday from another client and actor
OL,16,Fon the show, Vincent Curatola.
OL,18,FHe said that he had been found in his
OL,19,Fhome on New York's City Island after
OL,20,Fnot being heard from for a few days.
