OL,3,C'The Sopranos' actor Vincent Pastore
OL,4,Chas died aged 80
OL,6,FMcGowan said he'd been trying to reach
OL,7,FPastore about a possible job.
OL,9,F"He was the most loyal client and he
OL,10,Falways gave to charity," McGowan said,
OL,11,F"and he was the kind of guy who would
OL,12,Fhelp anybody, which is rare in my
OL,13,Fbusiness."
OL,15,FPastore appeared in movies dating back
OL,16,Fto the 1980s and had roles in big
OL,17,Fmovies including "Goodfellas" and
OL,18,F"Awakenings," both in 1990.
