OL,3,C'The Sopranos' actor Vincent Pastore
OL,4,Chas died aged 80
OL,6,FHe often played gangsters. And it was
OL,7,Fone of those roles he's best known
OL,8,Ffor: his 30-episode run as Salvatore
OL,9,FBonpensiero, the friend of Tony
OL,10,FSoprano who becomes an FBI informant
OL,11,Fin "The Sopranos."
OL,13,FFellow Sopranos star Michael Imperioli
OL,14,Fled tributes, writing on Instagram:
OL,15,F"Our beloved friend and collaborator
OL,16,FVincent Pastore has passed away.
OL,26,@sD@DOUsD@RO]
