OL,3,C'The Sopranos' actor Vincent Pastore
OL,4,Chas died aged 80
OL,6,F"This is a hard one for us, it seems
OL,7,Flike I've known Vinny forever. We did
OL,8,Flots of work together and travelled
OL,9,Fall over the USA as well as Italy and
OL,10,FAustralia. Lots of good times. Lots of
OL,11,Flaughs. Vinny was a kind hearted
OL,12,Fbrother who cared deeply about his
OL,13,Ffamily and friends. I will miss him
OL,14,Falways."
OL,16,FHe was born in the Bronx and grew up
OL,17,Fin suburban New Rochelle, New York. He
OL,18,Fenlisted in the Navy during the
OL,19,FVietnam War and later attended Pace
OL,20,FUniversity, according to his IMDb
OL,21,Fbiography.
